--TEST--
`prepareRename` on a top-level function's own name is refused, because a free function is not among the symbols rename covers, `rule:ide/no-refactoring-introduces-an-alias`
--FILE--
<?nvs
function hel<|>per(): int
{
    return 1;
}

echo helper();
--REQUEST--
prepareRename
--EXPECT--
refused: There is nothing to rename here. You can rename a class, a variable, a method, a property, a constant or an enum case.
